@startuml
title SEQ-08 — View product list
hide footbox
autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 300
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
actor "Guest / Customer" as Caller
control "ProductsController" as Entry
control "ProductsService" as Service
database "PostgreSQL\nproducts" as DB

activate Caller
Caller -> Entry: Search, filter, sort and paginate products
activate Entry
Entry -> Service: findAll(query)
activate Service
Service -> Service: Validate product query and pagination
alt A query field or pagination value is invalid
  Service --> Entry: The product query contains invalid values.
  Entry --> Caller: The product query contains invalid values.
else The query is valid
  Service -> DB: Find active products with stable sorting, offset, limit and total count
  activate DB
  DB --> Service: Return matching products and total
  deactivate DB
  Service --> Entry: Return products, offset, limit and total
  Entry --> Caller: Return products, offset, limit and total
end
deactivate Service
deactivate Entry
deactivate Caller
@enduml
